      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#raffald-1769\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003ERaffald 1769\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E;",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make Tea Cream.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTO half a pint of milk put a quarter of an ounce of fine Ceylon tea, boil them together, strain the leaves out, and put to the milk half a pint of cream, and two spoonfuls of rennet; set it over some hot embers in the dish you send it to table in, and cover it with a tin plate; when it is thick it is enough. Garnish with sweetmeats and send it up.\u003Cbr\u003E"
